{
  "_comment": "redesign W0-8b (T0-31). Ownership of the redesign families: the directories a family owns (UI and controllers), the App.js routes, the brand-system rulesets (by id prefix: id + \"-\" must match scripts/brand-system/<id>-*rules.json) and the vitest globs. Optional `specs`: globs of brand-system Playwright specs under e2e/brand-system that step 7 of gates.mjs runs for the family (growth: the transition specs that mount SchoolModuleToggle; operations: messages-shell, the /messages inbox; : stores schedule-consumers, the store schedule save; bi home-page; access auth-forms; shell confirm-admin-consumers, the shared ConfirmAdmin; : settings billing-d1-styles, the Stripe card styles of UI/Billing and ruleset l6-d1; shell isolation, the AppBootLoader boot contract). scripts/redesign/gates.mjs loads this file FAIL-CLOSED: a directory that does not exist, a route that is not in src/App.js, a ruleset that matches no file, or a test glob that matches nothing is an error. Paths may start with a prefix key (UI/, C/, CS/, PAGES/, SRC/), expanded from \"prefixes\". routes \"all\" = every route of App.js (the shell is mounted by all of them). Orders owns UI/Orders and its page only (decision of the coordinator); its controller tests (C/OrdersManage, C/OrderDetails, C/DashboardOrdersList, ...) still run in its `tests`. Families overlap on purpose where the plan says so (orders owns all of UI/Orders and operations owns its W1 subdirectories; the Product/Shared primitives live in the shell). Source: redesign/dashboard/plan.md (waves) and inventory.md (Rutas).",
